{"level":30,"time":1794928018017,"pid":20997,"hostname":"r179-30-55-14.dialup.mobile.ancel.net.uy","runId":"28850b65-19a3-4e53-9c8a-084301ef2aae","event":"model_response","response":{"result":{"candidate":{"name":"readFunctionBodyUntilCall","question":"Dans <file>, que configure <functionName> avant l'appel à <terminatorCall> ? Cite les lignes du corps de la fonction jusqu'à cet appel et indique les limites de la lecture.","description":"Locates the declaration of a named function in a given file via searchIdentifiers, then reads its body with readLines from the declaration line up to and including the first line containing a terminator call (e.g. initializeStorage). Returns the cited line range, the exact line texts, and a limits note stating that the read is static, that callee definitions and imports are not resolved, and that line numbers can drift if the file changes. If the terminator call is not found within maxLines, it returns the chunk read with a note instead of failing. Limits: syntactic evidence only; it does not execute code, resolve semantics, or search beyond the single file for the declaration.","source":"async ({ file, functionName, terminatorCall, maxLines = 50 }: { file: string; functionName: string; terminatorCall: string; maxLines?: number }) => {\n  const decl = await searchIdentifiers({ identifier: functionName });\n  const declHit = (decl.result || []).find(\n    (hit: { file: string; text: string }) =>\n      hit.file === file && hit.text.includes(\"function \" + functionName)\n  );\n  if (!declHit) {\n    throw new Error(\"Declaration of \" + functionName + \" not found in \" + file);\n  }\n  const start: number = declHit.line;\n  const chunk = await readLines({ file, startLine: start, endLine: start + maxLines - 1 });\n  const lines = chunk.result.lines;\n  const termIndex = lines.findIndex((l: { text: string }) =>\n    l.text.includes(terminatorCall)\n  );\n  const limits =\n    \"Static read only: no code was executed; callee definitions and imports are not resolved; line numbers may drift if the file changes.\";\n  if (termIndex === -1) {\n    return {\n      file,\n      startLine: start,\n      lines,\n      cited: null,\n      limits:\n        limits +\n        \" Terminator call '\" +\n        terminatorCall +\n        \"' not found within \" +\n        maxLines +\n        \" lines; increase maxLines to read further.\"\n    };\n  }\n  return {\n    file,\n    startLine: start,\n    lines: lines.slice(0, termIndex + 1),\n    cited: { startLine: start, endLine: lines[termIndex].line },\n    limits\n  };\n}","params":{"file":"player/index.ts","functionName":"registerPlayerModule","terminatorCall":"initializeStorage","maxLines":50}}},"usage":{"inputTokens":5132,"outputTokens":1253}},"model":{"model":"zai-glm-5-3-flash","temperature":0,"maxOutputTokens":16384}}
